            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">2021 09 10, LR: corretion of Urea input from 0.59 to 0.272 (0.59kg Urea/2.17kg Urea/kg Urea-N). Manufacturing process is considered with consumption of raw materials, energy, infrastructure and land use, as well as the generation of emissions to air.Transportation of raw materials is also included. Auxiliaries, solid wastes and emissions to water are not included due to the lack of information. Transport and storage of the final product are not included. No byproducts or coproducts are considered. Transcient or unstable operations are not considered, but the production during stable operation conditions. Emissions to air are considered as emanating in a high population density area. Inventory refers to 1 kg 100% urea-formaldehyde resin. The literature source used are Diem 2000 and von Däniken et al. 1995.;
